tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt

# Bolt codes of TEL: `subdivision 1` / `error 7` is ↯/t.1.7, which the TEL
# Specification formerly called E107. Subdivisions 1 to 5 are defined by the
# specifications in the `tel` repository, and are common to every
# implementation; subdivision 6 is the `tel` tool's own.

project t tel

  subdivision 1 parsing
    description  errors in a document's syntax (TEL Specification §19.3)
    error 1
      description  BOM present at start of document
    error 2
      description  Pragma is not the first non-blank line
    error 3
      description  Pragma line extends beyond first 4096 bytes
    error 4
      description  Invalid pragma version
    error 5
      description  Invalid sigil character
    error 6
      description  Line does not begin with the margin
    error 7
      description  Odd indentation
    error 8
      description  Trailing spaces on ordinary line
    error 9
      description  Comment must follow a blank line, another comment, or start of document
    error 10
      description  Line indent does not match any open compound's indent (reserved: the canonical parser never raises it)
    error 11
      description Over-indentation
    error 12
      description  Child of comment, tabulation, or tabulated row
    error 13
      description  Source atom already present on this compound
    error 14
      description  Literal atom already present on this compound
    error 15
      description  Unclosed literal atom
    error 16
      description  Tabulated row has wrong indentation
    error 17
      description  Hard space does not end at a column boundary
    error 18
      description  Column value exceeds maximum width
    error 19
      description  Malformed tabulation heading
    error 20
      description  Line-ending inconsistency
    error 21
      description  Pragma phrase matches no pragma form
    error 22
      description  Pragma phrases violate the positional order or multiplicity
    error 23
      description  Document is not well-formed UTF-8
    error 24
      description  Layer selections are not in the schema's declaration order

  subdivision 2 schema
    description  errors in a schema (TEL Specification §20.1)
    error 1
      description  Duplicate keyword within a Struct
    error 2
      description  Select member has empty variants list
    error 3
      description  Scalar has non-null default but member is not required
    error 4
      description  Two or more Layers share the same name
    error 5
      description  Layer Select variant keyword overlaps existing keyword in base Struct
    error 6
      description  Layer Field merge requires both base and layer types to be Struct
    error 7
      description  Schema.sigil character is not permitted
    error 8
      description  Keyword `tel` is reserved and must not be used as a Field or Variant keyword
    error 9
      description  Reference does not resolve to a Definition in the schema
    error 10
      description  Two or more Definitions share the same name
    error 11
      description  `exclude K` names a keyword that does not identify a Select variant in the merged Struct
    error 12
      description  `exclude K` would empty a required Select
    error 13
      description  Layer attempts to add a variant to an existing Select in a non-subtyping way
    error 14
      description  Layer cannot loosen a required member to optional
    error 15
      description  Layer cannot loosen an irrepeatable member to repeatable
    error 16
      description  Exclude operation appears outside a layer's SelectDefinition body
    error 17
      description  Reference/SelectRef kind mismatch (Reference resolved to a SelectDefinition, or SelectRef resolved to a Record/Scalar)
    error 18
      description  Layer declares a conflicting encoding for an existing scalar
    error 19
      description  Key field's type does not resolve to a Scalar
    error 20
      description  Key field must be effectively required and non-repeatable
    error 21
      description  More than one key field in a Struct
    error 22
      description  Invalid RE2 pattern
    error 23
      description  Layer pattern replacement is not contained in the inherited patterns
    error 24
      retired
      description  Formerly: a scalar declares neither `validate` nor `pattern`
    error 25
      description  Scalar `width` is not a positive decimal byte count
    error 26
      description  Layer declares a conflicting width for an existing scalar, or the width contradicts the encoding's fixed width
    error 27
      description  Scalar declares a `width` but no `encoding`
    error 28
      description  Field with an index is not repeatable, or its type is neither a Struct nor a Scalar, or a Scalar-typed field's index path is not the root path
    error 29
      description  Index path is not a syntactically valid TELP, or is the root path on a non-Scalar field
    error 30
      description  Index path does not resolve statically to a non-repeatable Scalar through non-repeatable Field members
    error 31
      description  Scalar declares both `width` and `intern`

  subdivision 3 validation
    description  a document which does not conform to its schema (TEL Specification §21.9)
    error 1
      description  Compound's type is not a Struct
    error 2
      description  More atoms than assignable member positions
    error 3
      description  Atom appears at a member position that is not atom-assignable
    error 4
      description  Atom text matches no variant keyword of a Select member
    error 5
      description  Atom text does not match a Field member's Flag keyword
    error 6
      description  Compound keyword is not recognized for its parent type
    error 7
      description  Required member absent and no default available
    error 8
      description  Non-repeatable member is filled more than once
    error 9
      description  Compound children of the same member are not contiguous
    error 10
      description  Scalar value failed validation
    error 11
      description  Flag-typed compound has atoms or compound children
    error 12
      description  Scalar value rejected by its type's codec encoder
    error 13
      description  Scalar type names a codec the codec binding does not provide
    error 14
      description  Duplicate key value among keyed children of one parent
    error 15
      description  Scalar value does not match a declared pattern

  subdivision 4 bintel
    description  errors in decoding BinTEL (BinTEL Specification §10)
    error 1
      description  magic number absent or invalid
    error 2
      description  malformed variable-length integer
    error 3
      description  invalid schema signature length
    error 4
      description  schema signature does not decode against the library
    error 5
      description  keyword index out of range
    error 6
      description  scalar value length extends beyond end of input
    error 7
      description  scalar value is not valid UTF-8
    error 8
      description  framing error: input bytes remain after document root
    error 9
      description  end of input reached mid-decode
    error 10
      description  Reference type does not resolve to a Definition
    error 11
      description  embedded schema body signature mismatch (self-contained mode)
    error 12
      description  embedded schema body is not a valid tels document (self-contained mode)
    error 13
      description  scalar's declared encoding is not resolved by the codec binding
    error 14
      description  encoded scalar's value bytes rejected by the codec decoder
    error 15
      description  codec canonicality check failed: re-encoded bytes differ
    error 16
      description  declared document length disagrees with the structural extent

  subdivision 5 ratel
    description  errors in reading RaTEL (RaTEL Specification §14)
    error 1
      description  Magic number is not `B1 C4 B5 BB`
    error 2
      description  Unsupported version byte
    error 3
      description  Reserved header byte or reserved flag bit non-zero
    error 4
      description  File shorter than 144 bytes; committed length `< 144`, greater than the file, or not a multiple of 8
    error 5
      description  A directory offset or length is not a multiple of 8, an offset is `< 144`, or `offset + length` exceeds the committed length
    error 6
      description  Two non-empty sections overlap
    error 7
      description  A section or header digest does not match, or the digests section's length is not `192` (flag bit 0 set); or flag bit 0 is clear and the digests section is non-empty
    error 8
      description  Schema signature structurally invalid — the ↯/t.4.3 conditions
    error 9
      description  Embedded schema body does not decode under `tels` — the ↯/t.4.12 condition
    error 10
      description  Recomputed composed signature differs from the carried signature — the ↯/t.4.11 condition
    error 11
      description  The schema cannot be laid out: unresolvable `Reference`/`SelectRef` (the ↯/t.4.10 condition), `intern` on a fixed-width scalar, a secondary-index path that does not resolve per §9.1
    error 12
      description  Table directory inconsistent with the layout: wrong `rowSize`, unknown `layout` byte, non-zero reserved bytes, misaligned offset, rows exceeding the section
    error 13
      description  Table 0 does not have exactly one row
    error 14
      description  A ref is not a multiple of 4, or an item's header or body extends beyond its region
    error 15
      description  A record index is `≥` its table's count, or a range's `start + count` exceeds it
    error 16
      description  A row reached twice during materialisation — aliasing or a cycle
    error 17
      description  A select tag is not the keyword index of one of the member's variants
    error 18
      description  A text scalar's bytes are not valid UTF-8 — the ↯/t.4.7 condition
    error 19
      description  An encoding named by the schema is not resolved by the codec binding — the ↯/t.4.13 condition
    error 20
      description  A codec's decoder rejects a value's bytes — the ↯/t.4.14 condition
    error 21
      description  OPTIONAL re-encode check found `encode(decode(b)) ≠ b` — the ↯/t.4.15 condition
    error 22
      description  *Writer:* a value of a `width w` scalar encodes to other than `w` bytes; the writer refuses. Never a reader condition
    error 23
      description  Index directory or entries malformed: unknown kind, entry count differing from `M`, non-zero reserved bytes, offsets non-monotone or beyond the section, an entry that does not parse
    error 24
      description  Index entries not in strictly increasing bytewise order
    error 25
      description  An index entry disagrees with the rows: host or child out of range, child outside the host's range, recomputed components differ, or the count differs from the children at the site
    error 26
      description  Non-zero bytes in an absent member's slot or in padding
    error 27
      description  The header's value hash differs from the BLAKE3-256 value hash of the materialised document

  subdivision 6 tool
    description  the `tel` command and its language server
    error 1 SchemaUnresolved
      description  a pragma names a schema which is not in the registry (information)
    error 2 LayerUnknown
      description  a pragma selects a layer its schema does not declare
    error 3 SignatureDisagrees
      description  a pragma's signature disagrees with the reference or selections beside it
    error 4 Unresolvable
      description  the path of a file to validate could not be resolved
    error 5 Unreadable
      description  a file to validate could not be read
    error 6 ServerTerminated
      description  the language server terminated abnormally
    error 7 TransportFailed
      description  the language server's transport failed
    error 8 UnrecognisedCommand
      description  the command was not recognised
    error 9 SchemasUnlistable
      description  the registry's schemas could not be listed
    error 10 SchemaNotAdded
      description  a schema could not be added to the registry
    error 11 SignatureUncomputable
      description  a schema's signature could not be computed
    error 12 SchemaUnknown
      description  no schema of that name is in the registry
    error 13 UpgradeNotApplied
      description  a staged upgrade of the tool was not applied
    error 14 UpgradeNotStaged
      description  an upgrade of the tool could not be staged
